      "Assignment 1": {
        "key_concepts": [
          {
            "section": {
              "header": "Assignment Requirements",
              "content": [
                {"image": {"src": "/Dave Churchill/Comp 4300/assignment_1-01.jpg", "caption": "Assignment 1 - Final Product"}},
                "Assignment 1 will display a number of different shapes in a window. The properties of all shapes will be defined in a configuration file. This will be an introductory assignment to familiarize yourself with:",
                ["File reading", "Setting up the window", "drawing basic shapes", "Creating a basic user interface"],
                {"image": {"src": "/Dave Churchill/Comp 4300/assignment_1-02.jpg", "caption": "The user interface in action"}},
                {
                  "section": {
                    "header": "Program Specifications",
                    "content": [
                      "You will write a program that will read descriptions of shapes from a configuration file, and then draw them to the screen. Each shape will have a name, position, speed, color, as well as properties unique to each shape. For example, a Rectangle will have a width and height, while a Circle will have a radius. The position of the shape refers to its upper-left corner.",
                      "The shapes are required to \"bounce\" off the sides of the application's window. That means that if the shape hits the left side of the widnow, its x-velocity is reversed. Likewise, if it hits the top of bottom of thw window its y-velocity is reversed. Each shape's name should be rendered in its exact center, in the font size and color defined in the configuration file.",
                      "A user interface is also needed that displays the following fields:",
                      [
                        "A list of all shapes that allows you to select a shape to edit its properties",
                        "Toggle whether or not the shape is drawn",
                        "Change the shape's scale (0 to 4)",
                        "Change the shape's x- and y-velocity (-8 to 8)",
                        "Change the shape's colour",
                        "Change the shape's name"
                      ],
                      {
                        "section": {
                          "header": "The Config File",
                          "content": [
                            "A sample configuration file is available below:",
                            "[i]config.txt[/i]",
                            {"code": "Window 1280 720\nFont fonts/tech.ttf 18 255 255 255\nCircle CGreen 100 100 -3 2 0 255 0 50\nCircle CBlue 200 200 2 4 0 0 255 100\nCircle CPurple 300 300 -2 -1 255 0 255 75\nRectangle RRed 200 200 4 4 255 0 0 50 25\nRectangle RGrey 300 250 -2 2 100 100 100 50 100\nRectangle RTeal 25 100 -2 -2 0 255 255 100 100"},
                            "",
                            "Each line of the configuration file specifies one of the config settings for the assignment. Each line follows a specific format:",
                            {
                              "section": {
                                "header": "Window W H",
                                "content": [
                                  "Declares the app window must be constructed with width W and height H.",
                                  {
                                    "table": [
                                      [{"td": "Size"}, {"td": "(W, H)"}, {"td": "int, int"}]
                                    ]
                                  }
                                ]
                              }
                            },
                            {
                              "section": {
                                "header": "Font F S R G B",
                                "content": [
                                  "Declares the font used to draw the text in the shapes.",
                                  {
                                    "table": [
                                      [{"td": "Font File"}, {"td": "F"}, {"td": "string"}],
                                      [{"td": "Font Size"}, {"td": "S"}, {"td": "int"}],
                                      [{"td": "Font RGB Colour"}, {"td": "(R, G, B)"}, {"td": "int, int, int"}]
                                    ]
                                  }
                                ]
                              }
                            },
                            {
                              "section": {
                                "header": "Rectangle N X Y SX SY R G B W H",
                                "content": [
                                  "Defines a Rectangle shape.",
                                  {
                                    "table": [
                                      [{"td": "Shape Name"}, {"td": "N"}, {"td": "string"}],
                                      [{"td": "Initial Position"}, {"td": "(X, Y))"}, {"td": "int, int"}],
                                      [{"td": "Initial Speed"}, {"td": "(SX, SY))"}, {"td": "int, int"}],
                                      [{"td": "RGB Colour"}, {"td": "(R, G, B)"}, {"td": "int, int, int"}],
                                      [{"td": "Size"}, {"td": "(W, H)"}, {"td": "int, int"}]
                                    ]
                                  }
                                ]
                              }
                            },
                            {
                              "section": {
                                "header": "Circle N X Y SX SY R G B RD",
                                "content": [
                                  "Defines a Circle shape.",
                                  {
                                    "table": [
                                      [{"td": "Shape Name"}, {"td": "N"}, {"td": "string"}],
                                      [{"td": "Initial Position"}, {"td": "(X, Y))"}, {"td": "int, int"}],
                                      [{"td": "Initial Speed"}, {"td": "(SX, SY))"}, {"td": "int, int"}],
                                      [{"td": "RGB Colour"}, {"td": "(R, G, B)"}, {"td": "int, int, int"}],
                                      [{"td": "Radius"}, {"td": "RD"}, {"td": "int"}]
                                    ]
                                  }
                                ]
                              }
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      }
